
% Mine

a: IV | I | V | vi | IV | I | V |
link_2: IV | I | V | vi | IV | I | V |
In: $a*2
Vr: $a*2
a_short: IV | I | V |
PCh: $a_short*4
b: IV | I | V | vi | V |
Ch: $b*2
link: IV |
c: vi | IV | V |
bridge: $c*2
a_slow: IV | I | V |
Ch_slow: $b $a_slow
S: [G] $In $Vr $PCh $Ch $link $Vr $PCh $Ch $link_2 $bridge $PCh $link $Ch_slow*4 $Ch
